pympacds (0.3.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * pympacds-admin: complete argparse help.
  * pympacds-admin install: support for custom programs and config files.
  * Ship a generated pympacds-admin(1) man page, built at package time from
    doc/cli.md with Sphinx.
  * Install the README and the example services under /usr/share/doc/.

